From: Nouveau GF117 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] nouveau: initialize voltage estimate metadata

Initialize the new provenance flag for all Nouveau voltage backends, even
when their enclosing object is not assumed to have been zero-filled.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/subdev/volt/base.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/subdev/volt/base.c
@@ -335,6 +335,7 @@
 
 	nvkm_subdev_ctor(&nvkm_volt, device, type, inst, &volt->subdev);
 	volt->func = func;
+	volt->readback_is_estimate = false;
 
 	/* Assuming the non-bios device should build the voltage table later */
 	if (bios) {
